D-Link DSL-G624T ADSL2/2+ Router

===== Supported Versions =====
^ Version/Model   ^ S/N   ^ OpenWrt Version Supported              ^ Model Specific Notes   ^
| A1 (EU)         | ESLG624TEU.A1G | 8.09+. Tested to work with 14.07 except for wireless, does **NOT** work with 15.05 | ADM6996M switch        |
The H/W version is written on a sticker on the bottom of the box.

===== Hardware Highlights =====
^ CPU                         ^ Ram    ^ Flash   ^ Network            ^ USB   ^ Serial   ^ JTag   ^
| TI AR7 (TNETD7300)@150MHz   | 16MB   | 4MB     | 4 x 1 + ADSL2/2+   | No    | Yes      | Yes    |

The DSL-G624T is an evolution of the previous ADSL1-only [[dsl-504t|DSL-504T]]. It is the same board of the wireless-deprived [[dsl-524t|DSL-G524T]] (the 524T board has empty soldering points for the mini-PCI slot where the G624T has the VLYNQ ACX wireless card). The H/W Ver.: A5 has 32MB ram onboard.


